Finds the five topics whose names are nearest a name, by spelling: the name is compared, trigram by trigram, with every name each topic was asked for under, so "rustlang" finds "Rust lang". It is cheap, so try it first. It searches every topic that stands, live or still in the queue, the name you are taking in included; a rejected topic never shows. Each comes with where it stands, its intake if it has one, the names it was asked for under, its requester's description, and the name match from 0 to 1. A close name is not the same topic: Rust the game and Rust the language share one, so compare subjects and angles before you merge.
